# Brand assets kept locally but not shipped would go here, one by one.
#
# Listed one by one on purpose rather than as a wildcard — public/ also
# holds the assets the site actually renders, and a blanket rule here
# would silently drop one of them from a deploy and break the logo in
# production with no build error.
#
# In use, must stay tracked: logo-light.svg, logo-dark.svg, mark.png
